/*
 * import_temperatures - server side importer for temperatures.csv
 *
 * Reads only complete lines from an append-only CSV (staged by rsync from the
 * Raspberry Pi) and inserts them into MySQL. The read offset is stored in the
 * database in the same transaction as the pending batch, so an import can be
 * repeated safely.
 *
 * The importer links the shared library (src_shared/libcore.a) but neither the
 * FOX toolkit nor any GUI code.
 *
 * See docs/mysql-import-plan.md
 */

